[00:20.10]God has a new creation,
[00:23.50]His spirit-anointed sons.
[00:29.08]He has bought them from mankind;
[00:34.10]His approval they’ve won.
[00:38.79](Chorus)
[00:38.94]A special possession,
[00:43.70]They’re a people for your name.
[00:48.78]They love you. They praise you.
[00:53.74]As one they declare abroad your fame.
[01:06.02]They are a holy nation,
[01:15.22]Who handle the truth aright.
[01:20.62]God has called them from darkness
[01:25.08]To his wonderful light.
[01:32.75](Chorus)
[01:32.90]A special possession,
[01:36.94]They’re a people for your name.
[01:42.72]They love you. They praise you.
[01:47.62]As one they declare abroad your fame.
[01:53.83]Faithful to their commission,
[02:00.98]They gather the other sheep.
[02:07.56]To the Lamb they are loyal.
[02:13.57]His commandments they keep.
[02:20.00](Chorus)
[02:20.15]A special possession,
[02:25.30]They’re a people for your name.
[02:32.17]They love you. They praise you.
[02:39.04]As one they declare abroad your fame.
